不在虚无缥缈间。\n山上仙人圯上老，一编亲辅汉龙颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22591,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上黄参政寿七首 其二","author":"许及之","text":"谁识金仙抱送时，年年惟有早梅知。\n只今不负调羹信，造化工深物自私。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22592,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上黄参政寿七首 其三","author":"许及之","text":"谏纸台评字字温，补天勋业妙谁论。\n风霜却是为霖手，桃李恩深更不言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22593,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上黄参政寿七首 其四","author":"许及之","text":"涉五经旬一风雨，三边安帖屡年丰。\n但知风虎云龙会，不见弥缝辅赞功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22594,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上黄参政寿七首 其五","author":"许及之","text":"补衮工夫日线长，天教岳降傍新阳。\n都人拟看貂蝉出，亲受君王饮福觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22595,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上黄参政寿七首 其六","author":"许及之","text":"自有中兴太学来，我公今始拜公台。\n胚胎元气真难事，五百年间命世才。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22596,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上黄参政寿七首 其七","author":"许及之","text":"度量汪汪见古风，衮衣只与布衣同。\n定知耐老耐官职，几个中书郭令公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22597,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又上梁丞相寿口号十首 其一","author":"许及之","text":"恭惟炎运恰中天，间气真成五百年。\n以舜继尧方诞圣，维申及甫即生贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22598,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又上梁丞相寿口号十首 其二","author":"许及之","text":"石笋金鸡传地谶，凤池虎榜属儒真。\n向来再世方稽验，今日兼荣孰比伦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22599,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又上梁丞相寿口号十首 其三","author":"许及之","text":"往分南国戎夷问，再入中台宇宙和。\n狡兔漫为三窟计，长城只倚一贤多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22600,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又上梁丞相寿口号十首 其四","author":"许及之","text":"庆成礼就端成殿，上寿仪陈德寿宫。\n霁日祥云回顷刻，燮调妙用不言功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22601,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又上梁丞相寿口号十首 其五","author":"许及之","text":"天数已周花甲子，中原合见汉威仪。\n极知庙略归樽俎，倚看元勋上鼎彝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22602,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又上梁丞相寿口号十首 其六","author":"许及之","text":"真人得道自崆峒，万国同归寿域中。\n致却升平更何事，朱颜绿发侍重瞳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22603,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又上梁丞相寿口号十首 其七","author":"许及之","text":"殿家前日中和节，相府今朝岳降辰。\n敕遣貂珰宣赐酒，黄封题作百千春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22604,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又上梁丞相寿口号十首 其八","author":"许及之","text":"万里云霄行白日，八荒桃李自春风。\n不须更弃人间事，一转钧陶九转功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22605,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又上梁丞相寿口号十首 其九","author":"许及之","text":"晓来微雨弄新晴，晚看蟾光一掐明。\n学语小儿争祝颂，相公长似月初生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22606,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又上梁丞相寿口号十首 其十","author":"许及之","text":"乾坤长物门阑客，会计丛中委吏身。\n拟算中书都几考，直须东海看扬尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22607,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农口号十首 其一","author":"许及之","text":"一劝农家莫惰农，春来雨水已流通。\n有男有女勤耕绩，必定时和更岁丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22608,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农口号十首 其二","author":"许及之","text":"二劝农家奉二亲，爷娘养尔望终身。\n但行孝顺勤耕种，天不亏人不到贫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22609,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农口号十首 其三","author":"许及之","text":"三劝农家敬主人，种它田土耐辛勤。\n若图借贷相怜恤，礼数须教上下分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22610,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农口号十首 其四","author":"许及之","text":"四劝农家劝主家，去年早稻失收多。\n未还旧欠无从出，随力周旋更借它。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22611,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农口号十首 其五","author":"许及之","text":"五劝农家劝善良，冒耕逃绝更思量。\n官司既许从今首，好与儿孙做久长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22612,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农口号十首 其六","author":"许及之","text":"六劝农家劝北乡，北乡田少尽茅冈。\n早禾有种何妨种，胜似閒教满地荒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22613,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农口号十首 其七","author":"许及之","text":"七劝农家趁雨时，陂塘蓄水是便宜。\n众人殖利还他殖，自饱须知别个饥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22614,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农口号十首 其八","author":"许及之","text":"八劝农家莫斗争，到官宁免废农耕。\n欺公毕竟添烦恼，作善安平过一生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22615,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农口号十首 其九","author":"许及之","text":"九劝农家纳税租，莫教县吏更追呼。\n只催常赋他无扰，合体公家有与无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22616,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农口号十首 其十","author":"许及之","text":"十劝农家各力田，长官无补近三年。\n民淳讼简因藏拙，谢汝分宜父老贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22617,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农毕事呈同官 其一","author":"许及之","text":"偶遵令甲得劭农，词鄙唯期与俗通。\n乍可催科成政拙，且须忧国愿年丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22618,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农毕事呈同官 其二","author":"许及之","text":"与民三载幸相亲，试邑何功得庇身。\n他日去思无可纪，较量惟只有清贫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22619,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农毕事呈同官 其三","author":"许及之","text":"扶犁感尔陇头人，自古民生合在勤。\n五斗空餐惭令尹，可怜无补及毫分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22620,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农毕事呈同官 其四","author":"许及之","text":"艰难功业属皇家，每为农桑下诏多。\n滥抚一同何补报，祇先劝课未皇他。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22621,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵才叔初春绝句 其一","author":"许及之","text":"柳眼虽舒未展眉，逗寒阴雨故逶迟。\n潘郎袖却春风手，正想经营得句时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22622,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵才叔初春绝句 其二","author":"许及之","text":"带围过膝杖过眉，曲庑寻诗得步迟。\n旧日春风应笑我，鬓边残雪没消时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22623,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次常之暑中即事韵五首 其一","author":"许及之","text":"自庇槐阴影更重，悠飏午梦半醒中。\n已看新绿看浓绿，不爱深红爱浅红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22624,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次常之暑中即事韵五首 其二","author":"许及之","text":"破暑薰风破甑轻，井泉新汲濯新清。\n乱蝉为我翻多事，时有黄鹂一个鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22625,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次常之暑中即事韵五首 其三","author":"许及之","text":"近凿方池漾碧虚，手栽初产玉芙蕖。\n丁宁未得轻开却，少待嘉宾约望舒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22626,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次常之暑中即事韵五首 其四","author":"许及之","text":"倦翼归来足退藏，卑飞决起自回翔。\n昨宵妙处无人领，不是风凉是月凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22627,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次常之暑中即事韵五首 其五","author":"许及之","text":"晚云蔽月气微清，假寐齁齁鼻自鸣。\n起看青天净如拭，月明于我不无情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22628,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵才叔和陈大用七夕绝句 其一","author":"许及之","text":"百两新迎碧汉车，半奁旧照古铜磨。\n蟾亏既望圆时数，鹊别经年恨处多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22629,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵才叔和陈大用七夕绝句 其二","author":"许及之","text":"小说无端漫五车，流传缪处盍刊磨。\n杜陵堪笑还堪惜，吟到佳期奏雅多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22630,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵才叔和陈大用七夕绝句 其三","author":"许及之","text":"宁少公荣莫少车，良辰僧坐笑砖磨。\n诗翁不至惟诗至，好句虽多恨亦多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22631,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵才叔和陈大用七夕绝句 其四","author":"许及之","text":"入秋逢节重星车，今闰中秋有折磨。\n夜夜银河映牛女，稍凉相过望君多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22632,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中山九日","author":"许及之","text":"恋阙怀亲一性成，车夫解事趣归程。\n松醪菊斝中山驿，蓟北江南万里情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22633,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蒋十一丈以重九雨昨有诗约闰九二首次韵 其一","author":"许及之","text":"风雨满城佳节休，诗翁强项觅因由。\n不须闰九方为节，眼底黄花即醉游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22634,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蒋十一丈以重九雨昨有诗约闰九二首次韵 其二","author":"许及之","text":"谁念渊明载酒过，杜陵愁思只悲歌。\n催租岂败潘郎意，语到愁边自不多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22635,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至早起 其一","author":"许及之","text":"千梳短发俨如霜，起坐中宵待一阳。\n人道阳生少灾障，才无袜线敢迎长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22636,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至早起 其二","author":"许及之","text":"百念消亡不动灰，犹怜云物拟登台。\n今秋幸自丰登甚，底事终朝隐隐雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22637,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至早起 其三","author":"许及之","text":"百里雷声足震惊，地温春近易敷荣。\n故人新有催梅句，催得阳和太半生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22638,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓起 其一","author":"许及之","text":"晚羃花房露霭霏，晓绷初脱笋芽肥。\n海棠已退来禽舍，滴滴胭脂正满枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22639,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓起 其二","author":"许及之","text":"莫想思堂想表勋，庉村佳处正相亲。\n花时不拚聊中酒，虚过清明箸莫人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22640,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新月","author":"许及之","text":"碧汉新磨印甲痕，山头忽堕玉钩寒。\n澄江只在青山外，忆得垂纶七里滩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22641,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"燕宾馆值雨","author":"许及之","text":"饱死侏儒便雨立，安知更有汉官仪。\n诸生未免谀绵蕝，从俗从宜我自嗤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22642,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"已晴复阴 其一","author":"许及之","text":"漠漠轻阴养絮天，长空跕跕堕飞鸢。\n东风吹得浮云绽，一片斜阳在晚川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22643,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"已晴复阴 其二","author":"许及之","text":"弄晴斜日展仍收，一向寒云凝不流。\n次第今宵还是雨，自添香灺煖衣篝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22644,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"已晴复阴 其三","author":"许及之","text":"读了残书不奈閒，挼挲老眼傍阑干。\n吟成白雪知何补，未有功名与世看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22645,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到京城日积雨欣霁","author":"许及之","text":"驱车日日望京师，冷雨潇潇共泪垂。\n一扫顽阴朝故阙，天开地辟亦如斯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22646,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新晴","author":"许及之","text":"暖日烘晴麦正秋，麦田高下五分收。\n稍苏凋瘵天之力，赈粜新来减几筹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22647,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午暑睡起忽怀范武子走笔当简 其一","author":"许及之","text":"读书岩中范武子，尔有此地何时归。\n岩边有石不可煮，世间万事巧相违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22648,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午暑睡起忽怀范武子走笔当简 其二","author":"许及之","text":"火云烁石畏出户，正似雪深坚卧时。\n吾甘饥冻死即死，触热生惭褦襶儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22649,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午暑睡起忽怀范武子走笔当简 其三","author":"许及之","text":"尔近添丁亦可喜，丁多何补于明时。\n除却操戈与执耒，此外文墨徒尔为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22650,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午暑睡起忽怀范武子走笔当简 其四","author":"许及之","text":"暑风翕翕树头动，吹过井梧方是凉。\n拂拭桃笙阴处卧，谁知我亦出羲皇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22651,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午暑睡起忽怀范武子走笔当简 其五","author":"许及之","text":"睡来只有茶一碗，共啜何人眼暂明。\n忽忆都钱范监库，种来脩竹似渠清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22652,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午暑睡起忽怀范武子走笔当简 其六","author":"许及之","text":"尔家阿换秀而温，三岁知音可共论。\n唱得痴顽三昧曲，新来何似许监门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22653,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次常之韵","author":"许及之","text":"清彻郊原带远洲，霏微小雨勿供愁。\n重阳已近休仍例，今岁丰登别是秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22654,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈张功甫 其一","author":"许及之","text":"乞得云台散吏归，园亭物物有光辉。\n临湖更要波光阔，付与沙鸥自在飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22655,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈张功甫 其二","author":"许及之","text":"插来杨柳已梳风，乞与渔师泊短篷。\n岁晚芦林总摇落，隔湖认得老邻翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22656,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈张功甫 其三","author":"许及之","text":"篮舆轧轧上梅桥，玉照崚嶒入望遥。\n梅与主人俱旧识，一年诗兴又相撩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22657,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵居甫六绝句 其一","author":"许及之","text":"君家城市俨山家，翠竹疏松靓物华。\n月桂似知新有句，封姨恰献旋开花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22658,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵居甫六绝句 其二","author":"许及之","text":"自入春来少见晴，雨愁花思共冥冥。\n浮红吹却浑閒事，正要秧针出水青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22659,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵居甫六绝句 其三","author":"许及之","text":"际天空翠滴人衣，拍岸波纹泛渺瀰。\n有意雨声停白昼，无端草色上朱扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22660,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵居甫六绝句 其四","author":"许及之","text":"雨飞蝴蝶尽争高，映水垂杨拂小桥。\n乍觉烟村风景别，突看林外出缃桃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":22661,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]